        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sat May 30, 10am | On May 30, the Metropolitan Opera’s 2025–26 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of American composer Gabriela Lena Frank’s first opera, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
