    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSSI Foundation: 40 Years of Giving Celebration Event\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tNovember 16, 2024 @ 1:00 pm - 3:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t(This is a non-ticketed event open to the community.)\nThe Foundation is excited to welcome the community to 40 Years of Giving – a 40th anniversary celebration highlighting the many impactful projects, volunteers, and donors that have come together to make Salt Spring a healthier and more caring community.\nJoin in celebrating over 1000 projects and $5.9M in funding and help shape the vision of the future, as the Foundation embarks on another 40+ years inspiring philanthropy and community health for the enduring benefit of those who make Salt Spring Island a healthy, nourishing and inclusive place to live.\n40 Years of Giving will feature stories about evolving community health and resiliency, from a variety of community organizations, both recent and more seasoned groups, with Foundation support.\nThe celebration will include:\nA photography exhibit of Foundation-funded projects throughout the years\nLive music from local guitarist Dan Howlett\nDelicious food from the Woodshed\nLocal trivia with prizes\nGuest speakers\nand more!\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t November 16, 2024 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1:00 pm - 3:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t ssifoundation.ca/40-years-of-giving-event/ \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Island Foundation\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPhone\t\t\t\t\