        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t18 events found.\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: New and Selected Paintings by Margarite S\\u00e1nchez\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Why not celebrate the beauty that surrounds us, the love that connects us, and the preciousness of this wild and beautiful life? This collection of original oil paintings, by Margarite S\\u00e1nchez, reflects on the extraordinary and ordinary moments that make this ephemeral existence so rich. Through the tender vulnerability of the human body, the lush [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/new-and-selected-paintings-by-margarite-sanchez/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-01T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-30T14:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Margarite S\\u00e1nchez\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"&#109;&#97;sa&#110;&#99;he&#122;&#64;sha&#119;.&#99;a\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Pretty, Not Pretty\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The fine-art photography exhibition &quot;Pretty NOT Pretty&quot; showcases the innovative works of artists Judy H McPhee and Anette Schrage, who each explore their unique interpretations of beauty. Through their lenses, they capture a diverse array of subjects, ranging from mundane everyday items to overlooked discarded objects, inviting viewers to reconsider conventional notions of beauty. This [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-pretty-not-pretty/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-01T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-30T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Judy H McPhee and Anette Schrage\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS: Fall Term\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fridays, Sep 12-Nov 21 |The Makana Choirs are the place to develop healthy singing habits, learn musical literary skills, and put on a concert. All while having fun with friends! Makana is directed by Caroni Young and accompanied by Cicela M\\u00e5nsson. ++ The Makana Kids Class is for singers in grades 2-5. This class is [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Slide_Makana3.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-fall-term-2/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-12T15:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-12T17:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"150\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-fall-term-2/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-07-22T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Seth Berkowitz Presents Open Spaces\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Empty Spaces is a photographic meditation on the social landscape, explored through scenes where human presence is absent but deeply felt. These images\\u2014of deserted streets, vacant interiors, and peripheral zones\\u2014highlight the traces of daily life and our collective behavior, values, and absences. The work considers emptiness not as void, but as a charged condition\\u2014where silence [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-seth-berkowitz-presents-open-spaces/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-01T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-30T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Seth Berkowitz\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://www.sethberkowitz.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://www.sethberkowitz.ca/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Sweetgrass Arts &#038; Music presents SS Island Indigenous Art Show: Lobby Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;A vibrant and diverse showcase by local Indigenous and M\\u00e9tis artists, featuring traditional and contemporary expressions. Explore intricate beadwork in the M\\u00e9tis floral style, eco art prints made from natural materials, pyrography (wood burning), as well as acrylic and watercolor paintings that reflect personal and cultural stories. Sculptural pieces add a three-dimensional element to the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/JUNE-2025_2Indigenous-Lobby.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/sweetgrass-arts-music-presents-ss-island-indigenous-art-show-lobby-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-06-04T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-10T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Sweetgrass Arts &#038; Music\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Reflections\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Pacifis Sands Resort Tofino Reflections is a collection of photographic works amassed over the past quarter century. These images explore the varying temperatures of the sun\\\\'s refraction across the globe and are influenced by the deep tonality and colours of nature. People, place, colour, and space converge in these compositions to evoke a sense of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-reflections/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-01T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-30T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Danielle Acken\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Femme Frequency: Lobby Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Femme Frequency is a vibrant visual art exhibit featuring a diverse group of local women artists, both established and emerging. With works in a variety of mediums, this show invites the community to discover new perspectives and be surprised by the creativity of women in their own backyard. From bold paintings to thought-provoking scenic art, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/femme-frequency-lobby-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-03T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-30T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Cimmeron Meyer\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Painters&#8217; Guild Workshop Show: Lobby Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;A display of works by Salt Spring Painters\\\\' members, done in Painters\\\\' Guild activities, under Guild instruction, or in our workshops, which reflect our diverse activities. The Guild promotes the artistic growth and self-expression of our members through encouragement, fellowship, mentoring and workshops. The only prerequisite to join us is a desire to draw and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-painters-guild-workshop-show-lobby-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-03-04T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-01T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Painters Guild\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Canada&#8217;s Polar Landscapes: Memories of a Geologist Lobby Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The extraordinary landscapes of Nunavut hold many secrets for a geologist with its unobstructed rock exposures due to a position above the treeline and significant fossil sites. For the last 15 years paleontologist Claudia Schr\\u00f6der-Adams conducted field expeditions in Canada\\u2019s polar regions to unravel the paleoclimatic history of the Arctic with paleoenvironments vastly different than [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/canadas-polar-landscapes-memories-of-a-geologist-lobby-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-02-04T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-02-28T14:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Claudia Schr\\u00f6der-Adams\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS REGISTRATION: Spring Term\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fridays, Jan 24-May 23 |REGISTER NOW | The Makana Youth Choirs are the place to develop healthy singing habits, learn musical literary skills, and put on a concert. All while having fun with friends! Makana is directed by Caroni Young and accompanied by Cicela M\\u00e5nsson. ** If the student is new, or is returning and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Copy-of-Slide_Makana2_.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-registration-2/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-01-24T15:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-01-24T17:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"147 \\u2013 167\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-registration-2/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-12-19T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SS Photography Club Annual ArtSpring Lobby Exhibition\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Every year, the SaltSpring Photography Club (SSPC) members are invited to submit any image the photographer wants to exhibit, without the constraints of size or subject matter for the annual January Lobby Show at ArtSpring. The dates this year (2025) are from January 7th through February 4th This show is an opportunity for Photo Club [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-photography-club-annual-artspring-lobby-exhibition/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-01-07T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-02-04T14:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Photography Club\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://ssphotog.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://ssphotog.ca/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"LOBBY EXHIBITION Salt Spring Groove &#8211; A Photographic Collection of Salt Spring Musicians\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;As a music photographer, my goal is to capture the excitement, passion, and intensity of live performance. These candid images reveal the soul of the performers, showing them at their best\\u2014how they want to be seen and remembered. For the audience, the photographs become a part of the experience, a way to relive the magic [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-salt-spring-groove-a-photographic-collection-of-salt-spring-musicians/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-12-04T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-12-21T14:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SS Foundation: 40 Years of Giving &#8212; In Pictures\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;40 Years of Giving \\u2013 In Pictures celebrates the diverse impact of Salt Spring Island Foundation-funded community projects over the past four decades. Through striking imagery, the exhibit highlights the Foundation\\u2019s commitment to the following nine key funding areas: Arts &amp; Culture Children and Youth Seniors Belonging, Equity &amp; Reconciliation Poverty Relief &amp; Economy Housing, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-foundation-40-years-of-giving-in-pictures/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-11-02T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-11-30T16:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Island Foundation\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://ssifoundation.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"250.537.8305\",\"email\":\"i&#110;fo&#64;ssi&#102;oundatio&#110;.ca\",\"sameAs\":\"https://ssifoundation.ca/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: League 181 &#8220;Working Together&#8221;\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;League 181 was established in 2013 by a small group of experienced painters with a compact of mutual help, learning and development.\\u00a0 The central idea is that we benefit by painting together in a group, both by discussion of the craft and by observation of each other. We have pleasure in presenting a selection of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-league-181-working-together/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-10-01T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-10-31T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"League 181\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS: Fall Term\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fridays, Sep 13-Nov 24 |The Makana Choirs are the place to develop healthy singing habits, learn musical literary skills, and put on a concert. All while having fun with friends! Makana is directed by Caroni Young and accompanied by Cicela M\\u00e5nsson. ++ The Makana Kids Class is for singers in grades 2-5. This class is [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Slide_Makana3.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-fall-term/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-09-13T15:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-09-13T17:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"145 \\u2013 165\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-fall-term/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-08-22T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Diverse Threads\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The Island Textile Artists latest show called &quot;Diverse Threads&quot; reflects the multitude of ways in which working with textiles creates pleasing and exciting art. Our group of nine members is very diverse. Some of us prefer hand stitching, others prefer machine stitching while some like to do gel prints or manipulate fabric with a heat [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-diverse-threads/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-09-03T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-09-30T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Megan Coupland\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;&quot;Making Lemonade&quot; It began in 2020, all three boys home all the time. I make the food offerings to appease them, array myself in the ragged vestments of my order and undertake the pilgrimage through my garden to the sacred ancient trailer that holds the tools of my faith. I complete the ritual choosing of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-megan-coupland/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-07-16T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-08-30T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Megan Coupland\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Lobby Exhibition: Sherry Leigh Williams &#038; Patricia Rose Williams, with Sheena Gering\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;New Event! Meet the Artists FRIDAY JUNE 21 | 10am-2pm Sherry Leigh Williams and Sheena Gering are hosting a &quot;Meet the Artist&quot; drop-in event within the Lobby Gallery space to conduct walk-and-talks about the work and their M\\u00e9tis culture, engage and answer questions, and Sheena will be conducting\\u00a0a beading and felted tufting demonstration. Live jazz [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/lobby-exhibition-sherry-leigh-williams-patricia-rose-williams/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-06-04T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-06-28T14:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\