e-love/2023-12-14/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2023-11-17T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"GISS Music Presents WIPEOUT!\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;GISS Music Presents its semester-end show, featuring the Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band, GISPA Music, and Guitar Class (complete with a surf-rock medley guitar ensemble extravaganza)! The perfect way to kick off the summer! 2 hours. Intermission. BUY TICKETS&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/31685/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-06-05T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-06-05T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"GISS Music\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/31685/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-05-16T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"GISS Music Presents Motown Mayhem!\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;From Motor Town to Salt Spring! Join GISS Music for some Motown Mayhem as they present their end of semester celebration and show. Featuring performances from all the large ensembles: Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band, and the Guitar Ensemble. There will also be solo and small group performances from the GISPA Music, Composition and Guitar [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-music-presents-motown-mayhem-3/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2024-12-19T19:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2024-12-19T21:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"GISS Music\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-music-presents-motown-mayhem-3/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-11-19T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"GISS Music Spring Concert: Chameleon\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sure to be a lively affair, the program is currently being finalized! Here\\\\'s what we do know -- the choir is doing a Pentatonix arrangement of Take on Me, as well as a piece about the history of the whale hunt and declining whale population. Jazz Band is performing Chameleon (hence the show title) as [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-music-spring-concert-chameleon/2025-05-23/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-23T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-23T20:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"GISS Music\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-music-spring-concert-chameleon/2025-05-23/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-04-10T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"}]\n\n\t\t\n\t{\"slug\":\"organizer\",\"prev_url\":\"https:\\/\\/artspring.ca\\/organizer\\/giss-music\\/page\\/2\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&eventDisplay=past\",\"next_url\":\"https:\\/\\/artspring.ca\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&eventDisplay=organizer&tribe_organizer