\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music presents their year-end spectacular! Featuring students from the guitar class, GISPA Music, Concert Band, Jazz Band, and Choir. Come celebrate the end of the school year with a bang! With intermission and concessions. BUY TICKETS\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10 – $15\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tDecember 2023\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t14\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDecember 14, 2023 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS Music Presents: All Together We Are Love\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Presents: All Together We Are Love\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tCome join us for our GISS Music winter showcase! The show will feature students from the Composition/Songwriting Class, GISPA Music, Concert Band, Jazz Band and Choir. The comp class will be divided over two nights, so come to both nights to make sure you get all the music! With intermission and concessions. BUY TICKETS\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10 – $15\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2024\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t5\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 5, 2024 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Presents WIPEOUT!\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music Presents its semester-end show, featuring the Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band, GISPA Music, and Guitar Class (complete with a surf-rock medley guitar ensemble extravaganza)! The perfect way to kick off the summer! 2 hours. Intermission. BUY TICKETS\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tDecember 2024\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t19\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDecember 19, 2024 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS Music Presents Motown Mayhem!\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Presents Motown Mayhem!\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tFrom Motor Town to Salt Spring! Join GISS Music for some Motown Mayhem as they present their end of semester celebration and show. Featuring performances from all the large ensembles: Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band, and the Guitar Ensemble. There will also be solo and small group performances from the GISPA Music, Composition and Guitar […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10 – $30\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMay 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t23\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMay 23, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 8:30 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS Music Spring Concert: Chameleon\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Spring Concert: Chameleon\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tSure to be a lively affair, the program is currently being finalized! Here's what we do know -- the choir is doing a Pentatonix arrangement of Take on Me, as well as a piece about the history of the whale hunt and declining whale population. Jazz Band is performing Chameleon (hence the show title) as […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$15\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPrevious Events\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\tToday\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNext Events\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSubscribe to calendar\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport Outlook .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t( function () {\n\t\tvar completed = false;\n\n\t\tfunction initBreakpoints() {\n\t\t\tif ( completed ) {\n\t\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'function' !== typeof (window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup) ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tvar container = document.querySelectorAll( '[data-view-breakpoint-pointer=\"41bf368e-dd23-433f-8f5b-4204d4672968\"]' );\n\t\t\tif ( ! container ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\twindow.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup( container );\n\t\t\tcompleted = true;\n\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t// Try to init the breakpoints right away.\n\t\tinitBreakpoints();\n\t\tdocument.addEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t})();\n\n{\"tvn1\":\"19b147ab5d\",\"tvn2\":\"\"}\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
